{TEXT("Wex 喷火工兵擅长清理近处掩体，射程短，燃料有限。用烟幕掩护接近；喷火手能承受少量枪击，但爆炸仍可将其击杀并引燃储罐。"),TEXT("Wex flame pioneers clear nearby cover, with short range and limited fuel. Use smoke for the approach. The operator can withstand some gunfire, but explosions can kill him and ignite the tank."),TEXT("The Wex reservoir moves forward beside the trench wall. Its jet clears close cover, with smoke helping the approach; fuel is limited and blasts may ignite the tank.\nThe operator resists scattered rifle fire better, but a blast can still kill outright.")},

// B.U6
{TEXT("皇家工兵可清除铁丝和地雷，连续施工可加固战壕，减少驻军遭到的正面枪击。炮火可摧毁工事。\n后期可抢修履带，恢复至半数耐久。附近有敌军或受到压制时，作业会中断。"),TEXT("Royal Engineers clear wire and mines. Sustained work fortifies a trench against frontal gunfire; shellfire can destroy the work.\nLater equipment allows track repairs to half durability. Nearby enemies or suppression interrupt work."),TEXT("皇家工兵在铁丝间剪出通路。\n清除障碍，并在掩护下修筑工事。第 2 关起，停步施工 12 秒可筑成壕肩；两人驻守时，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%，炮火可摧毁工事。\n第 9 关起，可用 12 秒修复一侧履带至半数耐久，每侧限一次。近敌与压制会中断作业。")},
