// B.Sniper
{TEXT("一名 SMLE 狙击手、一名持步枪的观察手，擅长远距离攻击固定枪位。烟幕和压制会妨碍瞄准，两人小组难以应付近战。"),TEXT("One SMLE sniper and one rifle-armed spotter attack fixed posts at long range. Smoke and suppression disrupt aim; the two-man team is weak in close combat."),TEXT("望远瞄准镜找到敌方枪口。狙击手擅长打击固定机枪，观察手近距掩护；人数少，烟雾和压制会打断瞄准。\n编制：1名狙击手、1名制式步枪观察手。")},
{TEXT("一名 SMLE 狙击手、一名持步枪的观察手，擅长远距离攻击固定枪位。烟幕和压制会妨碍瞄准，两人小组难以应付近战。"),TEXT("One SMLE sniper and one rifle-armed spotter attack fixed posts at long range. Smoke and suppression disrupt aim; the two-man team is weak in close combat."),TEXT("镜瞄 SMLE 从狙击学校送往前沿。\n一名狙击手、一名步枪观察手，以更远、更准的射击威胁固定枪位。烟雾和压制妨碍瞄准，近战兵力薄弱。")},
{TEXT("一名 SMLE 狙击手、一名持步枪的观察手，擅长远距离攻击固定枪位。烟幕和压制会妨碍瞄准，两人小组难以应付近战。"),TEXT("One SMLE sniper and one rifle-armed spotter attack fixed posts at long range. Smoke and suppression disrupt aim; the two-man team is weak in close combat."),TEXT("Scoped SMLEs arrive from sniper school.\nOne sniper and one rifle-armed spotter threaten fixed guns with greater range and accuracy. Smoke and suppression disrupt aim; the pair is weak in close combat.")},
{TEXT("一名 SMLE 狙击手、一名持步枪的观察手，擅长远距离攻击固定枪位。烟幕和压制会妨碍瞄准，两人小组难以应付近战。"),TEXT("One SMLE sniper and one rifle-armed spotter attack fixed posts at long range. Smoke and suppression disrupt aim; the two-man team is weak in close combat."),TEXT("狙击学校的镜瞄步枪送到前沿。\n一名狙击手与一名步枪观察手。以更远、更准的射击对付固定枪位；烟雾和压制妨碍瞄准，近战兵力不足。")},
{TEXT("一名 SMLE 狙击手、一名持步枪的观察手，擅长远距离攻击固定枪位。烟幕和压制会妨碍瞄准，两人小组难以应付近战。"),TEXT("One SMLE sniper and one rifle-armed spotter attack fixed posts at long range. Smoke and suppression disrupt aim; the two-man team is weak in close combat."),TEXT("A scoped rifle arrives from sniper school.\nOne sniper and one rifle-armed spotter. Greater range and accuracy threaten fixed guns. Smoke and suppression disrupt aim; the pair has little strength in close combat.")},
{TEXT("一名 SMLE 狙击手、一名持步枪的观察手，擅长远距离攻击固定枪位。烟幕和压制会妨碍瞄准，两人小组难以应付近战。"),TEXT("One SMLE sniper and one rifle-armed spotter attack fixed posts at long range. Smoke and suppression disrupt aim; the two-man team is weak in close combat."),TEXT("A telescopic sight finds the enemy gun. The sniper counters stationary machine guns while his rifle-armed spotter guards the approach. Smoke and suppression interrupt aim.\nPair: one sniper and one service-rifle spotter.")},

// G.Storm
{TEXT("MP 18 突击队以自动火力和手雷夺取近处战壕。射程短，换弹时停止射击；接近远射步兵和坦克时需要掩护。"),TEXT("MP 18 assault troops take nearby trenches with automatic fire and grenades. Short range and reload pauses leave them needing cover against long-range infantry and tanks."),TEXT("MP 18 的枪声追过下一道壕角。\n以自动火力和手雷争夺近壕。射程短，换弹时火力中断；远射与坦克能阻止突击。")},
{TEXT("MP 18 突击队以自动火力和手雷夺取近处战壕。射程短，换弹时停止射击；接近远射步兵和坦克时需要掩护。"),TEXT("MP 18 assault troops take nearby trenches with automatic fire and grenades. Short range and reload pauses leave them needing cover against long-range infantry and tanks."),TEXT("MP 18 随先遣队进入敌壕。\n自动火力与手雷擅长近距离突击。射程短，换弹中断火力；远射和坦克能阻止接近。")},
{TEXT("MP 18 突击队以自动火力和手雷夺取近处战壕。射程短，换弹时停止射击；接近远射步兵和坦克时需要掩护。"),TEXT("MP 18 assault troops take nearby trenches with automatic fire and grenades. Short range and reload pauses leave them needing cover against long-range infantry and tanks."),TEXT("MP 18s enter the trench with the leading party.\nAutomatic fire and grenades excel at close assault. Short range and reload pauses leave the section vulnerable to distant guns and tanks.")},
{TEXT("MP 18 突击队以自动火力和手雷夺取近处战壕。射程短，换弹时停止射击；接近远射步兵和坦克时需要掩护。"),TEXT("MP 18 assault troops take nearby trenches with automatic fire and grenades. Short range and reload pauses leave them needing cover against long-range infantry and tanks."),TEXT("MP 18 的短点射沿壕壁回响。风暴队以自动火力和手雷争夺近壕；射程短，换弹时需要掩护，无法独自对付坦克。")},
{TEXT("MP 18 突击队以自动火力和手雷夺取近处战壕。射程短，换弹时停止射击；接近远射步兵和坦克时需要掩护。"),TEXT("MP 18 assault troops take nearby trenches with automatic fire and grenades. Short range and reload pauses leave them needing cover against long-range infantry and tanks."),TEXT("MP 18 fire follows the assault round the traverse.\nAutomatic weapons and grenades excel in close trenches. Short range and reload pauses leave the section vulnerable to distant guns and tanks.")},
{TEXT("MP 18 突击队以自动火力和手雷夺取近处战壕。射程短，换弹时停止射击；接近远射步兵和坦克时需要掩护。"),TEXT("MP 18 assault troops take nearby trenches with automatic fire and grenades. Short range and reload pauses leave them needing cover against long-range infantry and tanks."),TEXT("Short MP 18 bursts echo along the trench wall. Storm troops contest close trenches with automatic fire and grenades; limited range and reload pauses leave them vulnerable to distant guns and tanks.")},

// B.Officer
{TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，停步时可重整较大范围内的部队。同类指挥加成不叠加；重压制或阵亡会使指挥中断。\n完成观察训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。"),TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and rallies troops over a wider area while halted. Officer bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression or death interrupts command.\nAfter observation training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target."),TEXT("一纸战地委任书，连队多了一名指挥官。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%；军官停步时每 6 秒在较大范围内重整友军。同类加成不叠加，重压或阵亡会中断指挥。\n完成观察研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒，可为可见目标校射。")},
{TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，停步时可重整较大范围内的部队。同类指挥加成不叠加；重压制或阵亡会使指挥中断。\n完成观察训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。"),TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and rallies troops over a wider area while halted. Officer bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression or death interrupts command.\nAfter observation training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target."),TEXT("战地委任状送到连部。\n近旁部队命中率提高 50%。军官停步时可重整更大范围内受压制的部队；同类指挥不叠加，重压制或阵亡会中断指挥。\n完成观测训练后，军官须有同伴掩护，停步观察可见目标，才能为炮兵校射。")},
{TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，停步时可重整较大范围内的部队。同类指挥加成不叠加；重压制或阵亡会使指挥中断。\n完成观察训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。"),TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and rallies troops over a wider area while halted. Officer bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression or death interrupts command.\nAfter observation training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target."),TEXT("A field commission reaches company headquarters.\nNearby troops gain 50% accuracy. A halted officer rallies suppressed troops across a wider area. Command bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression or death breaks command.\nObservation training allows a halted, escorted officer to correct artillery fire against visible targets.")},
{TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，停步时可重整较大范围内的部队。同类指挥加成不叠加；重压制或阵亡会使指挥中断。\n完成观察训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。"),TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and rallies troops over a wider area while halted. Officer bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression or death interrupts command.\nAfter observation training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target."),TEXT("军官在壕口向前队传令。附近友军得到更强指挥，停步后可缓解更大范围的压制；重压或失去组长会中断加成。\n战术：命中率+50%，不叠加；每6秒重整。观察研习后，携同伴停稳2秒可校射可见目标。Webley用于近身自卫。")},
{TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，停步时可重整较大范围内的部队。同类指挥加成不叠加；重压制或阵亡会使指挥中断。\n完成观察训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。"),TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and rallies troops over a wider area while halted. Officer bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression or death interrupts command.\nAfter observation training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target."),TEXT("委任书送到前沿，军士接过 Webley。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%，同类指挥不叠加。停步时每 6 秒重整较大范围的友军。重压或军官阵亡会中断指挥。\n完成观察研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒可为可见目标校射。")},
{TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，停步时可重整较大范围内的部队。同类指挥加成不叠加；重压制或阵亡会使指挥中断。\n完成观察训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。"),TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and rallies troops over a wider area while halted. Officer bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression or death interrupts command.\nAfter observation training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target."),TEXT("A commission reaches the front, and a Webley changes hands.\nNearby allies gain 50% accuracy without stacking. While halted, the officer rallies a wider area every 6 seconds. Heavy suppression or his death breaks command.\nAfter observation training, halt with an escort for 2 seconds to correct fire onto visible targets.")},
{TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，停步时可重整较大范围内的部队。同类指挥加成不叠加；重压制或阵亡会使指挥中断。\n完成观察训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。"),TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and rallies troops over a wider area while halted. Officer bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression or death interrupts command.\nAfter observation training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target."),TEXT("A field commission appoints a company officer.\nNearby troops gain 50% accuracy. While halted, he rallies a wider area every 6 seconds. Bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression or death breaks command.\nWith observation training and an escort, a 2-second halt allows corrections against visible targets.")},
{TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，停步时可重整较大范围内的部队。同类指挥加成不叠加；重压制或阵亡会使指挥中断。\n完成观察训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。"),TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and rallies troops over a wider area while halted. Officer bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression or death interrupts command.\nAfter observation training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target."),TEXT("The officer carries orders to the leading section. He gives stronger command support and rallies a wider area while halted; heavy suppression or his death ends the bonus.\nTactics: +50% accuracy, no stacking; rally every 6s. With observation training and an escort, halt for 2s to correct visible targets. The Webley is for close defence.")},

// G.Officer
{TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，行进中也能缓解友军压制。指挥范围小于英军；同类加成不叠加，重压制会使指挥中断。\n完成测地训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。"),TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and can rally troops while moving. His command area is smaller than the British officer’s; officer bonuses do not stack and heavy suppression interrupts command.\nAfter survey training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target."),TEXT("军官握着 P08 跟上前队。附近友军得到更强指挥，行进中也能重整部队；指挥范围略小于英军，重压会中断加成。\n战术：命中率+50%，不叠加；每6秒重整。炮位测地研习后，携同伴停稳2秒可校射可见目标。")},
{TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，行进中也能缓解友军压制。指挥范围小于英军；同类加成不叠加，重压制会使指挥中断。\n完成测地训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。"),TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and can rally troops while moving. His command area is smaller than the British officer’s; officer bonuses do not stack and heavy suppression interrupts command.\nAfter survey training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target."),TEXT("军官随前沿队伍推进。\n近旁部队命中率提高 50%，行进中也能缓解友军压制。指挥范围小于英军；同类指挥不叠加，重压制会中断指挥。\n完成测地训练后，军官须有同伴掩护，停步观察可见目标，才能为炮兵校射。")},
{TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，行进中也能缓解友军压制。指挥范围小于英军；同类加成不叠加，重压制会使指挥中断。\n完成测地训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。"),TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and can rally troops while moving. His command area is smaller than the British officer’s; officer bonuses do not stack and heavy suppression interrupts command.\nAfter survey training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target."),TEXT("The officer advances with the leading party.\nNearby troops gain 50% accuracy and recover from suppression even on the move. His reach is shorter than the British officer’s. Command bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression breaks command.\nSurvey training allows a halted, escorted officer to correct artillery fire against visible targets.")},
{TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，行进中也能缓解友军压制。指挥范围小于英军；同类加成不叠加，重压制会使指挥中断。\n完成测地训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。"),TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and can rally troops while moving. His command area is smaller than the British officer’s; officer bonuses do not stack and heavy suppression interrupts command.\nAfter survey training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target."),TEXT("军官跟随前队，以短促口令保持队形。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%；每 6 秒重整友军，行进中仍可下令。指挥范围略小于英军，同类加成不叠加；重压会中断指挥。\n完成炮位测地研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒，可为可见目标校射。")},
{TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，行进中也能缓解友军压制。指挥范围小于英军；同类加成不叠加，重压制会使指挥中断。\n完成测地训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。"),TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and can rally troops while moving. His command area is smaller than the British officer’s; officer bonuses do not stack and heavy suppression interrupts command.\nAfter survey training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target."),TEXT("军官随前队推进，以短促口令保持队形。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%，同类指挥不叠加。每 6 秒重整友军，行进中也可下令；范围略小于英军，重压会中断指挥。\n完成炮位测地研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒可为可见目标校射。")},
{TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，行进中也能缓解友军压制。指挥范围小于英军；同类加成不叠加，重压制会使指挥中断。\n完成测地训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。"),TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and can rally troops while moving. His command area is smaller than the British officer’s; officer bonuses do not stack and heavy suppression interrupts command.\nAfter survey training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target."),TEXT("P08 in hand, the officer follows the advance. He gives stronger command support and can rally while moving; his reach is shorter than the British officer's, and heavy suppression breaks command.\nTactics: +50% accuracy, no stacking; rally every 6s. With battery-survey training and an escort, halt for 2s to correct visible targets.")},
{TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，行进中也能缓解友军压制。指挥范围小于英军；同类加成不叠加，重压制会使指挥中断。\n完成测地训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。"),TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and can rally troops while moving. His command area is smaller than the British officer’s; officer bonuses do not stack and heavy suppression interrupts command.\nAfter survey training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target."),TEXT("The officer advances with the leading men, keeping them under orders.\nNearby allies gain 50% accuracy without stacking. He rallies every 6 seconds, even while moving. His reach is shorter than the British officer's; heavy suppression breaks command.\nAfter battery-survey training, halt with an escort for 2 seconds to correct visible targets.")},
{TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，行进中也能缓解友军压制。指挥范围小于英军；同类加成不叠加，重压制会使指挥中断。\n完成测地训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。"),TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and can rally troops while moving. His command area is smaller than the British officer’s; officer bonuses do not stack and heavy suppression interrupts command.\nAfter survey training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target."),TEXT("The officer moves with the leading party.\nNearby troops gain 50% accuracy and rally every 6 seconds, even on the move. His command reaches less far than the British officer's. Bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression breaks command.\nWith survey training and an escort, a 2-second halt allows corrections against visible targets.")},

// S.0
{TEXT("野炮多轮轰击指定区域，适合攻击固定阵地和集结部队。传令延迟和炮弹散布使移动目标较难命中；弹着区内的友军同样会受伤。"),TEXT("Field guns bombard the selected area in several groups, suited to fixed positions and massed troops. Order delays and shell scatter make moving targets harder to hit. Friendly troops in the impact area are also at risk."),TEXT("炮长在电话那端复诵方位。\n多轮野炮轰击指定区域。适合固定阵位和集结部队；传令延迟与散布使移动目标较难命中，也会杀伤友军。")},
{TEXT("野炮多轮轰击指定区域，适合攻击固定阵地和集结部队。传令延迟和炮弹散布使移动目标较难命中；弹着区内的友军同样会受伤。"),TEXT("Field guns bombard the selected area in several groups, suited to fixed positions and massed troops. Order delays and shell scatter make moving targets harder to hit. Friendly troops in the impact area are also at risk."),TEXT("电话线接通，炮兵复诵方位。\n多轮炮火覆盖指定地域，打击固定阵位与集结部队。传令延迟和散布使移动目标较难命中；友军也会遭到杀伤。")},
{TEXT("野炮多轮轰击指定区域，适合攻击固定阵地和集结部队。传令延迟和炮弹散布使移动目标较难命中；弹着区内的友军同样会受伤。"),TEXT("Field guns bombard the selected area in several groups, suited to fixed positions and massed troops. Order delays and shell scatter make moving targets harder to hit. Friendly troops in the impact area are also at risk."),TEXT("The battery repeats the bearing over the telephone.\nSeveral salvos strike the selected area, threatening fixed positions and concentrations. Delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets; friendly troops are also at risk.")},
{TEXT("野炮多轮轰击指定区域，适合攻击固定阵地和集结部队。传令延迟和炮弹散布使移动目标较难命中；弹着区内的友军同样会受伤。"),TEXT("Field guns bombard the selected area in several groups, suited to fixed positions and massed troops. Order delays and shell scatter make moving targets harder to hit. Friendly troops in the impact area are also at risk."),TEXT("电话那端，炮长复诵方位。野炮以多轮爆炸覆盖指定地段；传令延迟和散布使移动目标更难命中。\n落弹区内的友军同样受伤。")},
{TEXT("野炮多轮轰击指定区域，适合攻击固定阵地和集结部队。传令延迟和炮弹散布使移动目标较难命中；弹着区内的友军同样会受伤。"),TEXT("Field guns bombard the selected area in several groups, suited to fixed positions and massed troops. Order delays and shell scatter make moving targets harder to hit. Friendly troops in the impact area are also at risk."),TEXT("At the other end of the wire, the battery repeats the bearing. Several salvos cover the chosen ground; delay and scatter make moving targets harder to hit.\nFriendly troops in the impact area are also at risk.")},
{TEXT("野炮多轮轰击指定区域，适合攻击固定阵地和集结部队。传令延迟和炮弹散布使移动目标较难命中；弹着区内的友军同样会受伤。"),TEXT("Field guns bombard the selected area in several groups, suited to fixed positions and massed troops. Order delays and shell scatter make moving targets harder to hit. Friendly troops in the impact area are also at risk."),TEXT("The battery repeats the bearing over the wire.\nSeveral salvos cover the selected area. Effective against fixed positions and concentrations; delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets. Friendly troops can be killed.")},

