{TEXT("两轮烟幕掩护推进和撤退，遮蔽双方观察，降低枪弹命中率。炮弹仍可穿过烟幕。"),TEXT("Two smoke groups cover advances and withdrawals, obscure observation on both sides and reduce bullet accuracy. Shells can still pass through."),TEXT("Smoke shells burst across no man's land.\nTwo groups screen advances and withdrawals, obscuring both armies' observation and direct fire. Shells pass through the screen.")},
{TEXT("两轮烟幕掩护推进和撤退，遮蔽双方观察，降低枪弹命中率。炮弹仍可穿过烟幕。"),TEXT("Two smoke groups cover advances and withdrawals, obscure observation on both sides and reduce bullet accuracy. Shells can still pass through."),TEXT("烟弹在无人区接连破裂。\n两轮烟幕掩护推进或撤离，削弱双方观察与直射火力。炮弹仍能穿过烟幕。")},
{TEXT("两轮烟幕掩护推进和撤退，遮蔽双方观察，降低枪弹命中率。炮弹仍可穿过烟幕。"),TEXT("Two smoke groups cover advances and withdrawals, obscure observation on both sides and reduce bullet accuracy. Shells can still pass through."),TEXT("Smoke shells burst across no man's land.\nTwo groups screen an advance or withdrawal, reducing both armies' observation and direct fire. Shells still pass through the smoke.")},
