{TEXT("迫击炮以四轮炮弹攻击固定枪位和拥挤壕道。响应较慢，移动目标可能在炮弹抵达前离开；友军须避开弹着区。"),TEXT("Four mortar salvos attack fixed posts and crowded trenches. The slow response gives moving targets time to leave before impact. Keep friendly troops clear of the target area."),TEXT("Mortar bombs pass over the parapet. Mortars strike fixed guns and crowded trenches; their slow response calls for anticipation, with friendly troops following the final impacts.\nDelivery: 4 groups.")},
{TEXT("迫击炮以四轮炮弹攻击固定枪位和拥挤壕道。响应较慢，移动目标可能在炮弹抵达前离开；友军须避开弹着区。"),TEXT("Four mortar salvos attack fixed posts and crowded trenches. The slow response gives moving targets time to leave before impact. Keep friendly troops clear of the target area."),TEXT("The carrying party brings bombs to the trench mortar.\nFour groups strike fixed guns and crowded trenches. Slow response rewards anticipating enemy concentrations. Friendly troops in the barrage are also at risk.")},

// S.4
{TEXT("毒云随风漂移，遮蔽视线并杀伤持续暴露的步兵，也会伤及友军。正确佩戴呼吸器可大幅减缓毒气累积。"),TEXT("Gas drifts with the wind, obscuring sight and harming exposed infantry on either side. Properly fitted respirators greatly slow gas accumulation."),TEXT("气弹破裂，警铃沿壕传开。\n毒云随风漂移，遮蔽视线并杀伤滞留步兵，也会威胁友军。完成佩戴的呼吸器大幅减缓毒气累积。")},
{TEXT("毒云随风漂移，遮蔽视线并杀伤持续暴露的步兵，也会伤及友军。正确佩戴呼吸器可大幅减缓毒气累积。"),TEXT("Gas drifts with the wind, obscuring sight and harming exposed infantry on either side. Properly fitted respirators greatly slow gas accumulation."),TEXT("警铃响起，毒云顺风压向壕道。\n遮蔽视线，杀伤持续暴露的步兵，也危及友军。密封佩戴的呼吸器可大幅减缓毒气累积。")},
{TEXT("毒云随风漂移，遮蔽视线并杀伤持续暴露的步兵，也会伤及友军。正确佩戴呼吸器可大幅减缓毒气累积。"),TEXT("Gas drifts with the wind, obscuring sight and harming exposed infantry on either side. Properly fitted respirators greatly slow gas accumulation."),TEXT("The gas alarm sounds as the cloud drifts downwind.\nObscures sight and kills infantry that remain exposed, including allies. A sealed respirator greatly slows gas exposure.")},
{TEXT("毒云随风漂移，遮蔽视线并杀伤持续暴露的步兵，也会伤及友军。正确佩戴呼吸器可大幅减缓毒气累积。"),TEXT("Gas drifts with the wind, obscuring sight and harming exposed infantry on either side. Properly fitted respirators greatly slow gas accumulation."),TEXT("气弹破裂，警铃沿壕传开。毒云随风漂移，遮蔽观察并威胁久留的步兵；风也会把毒气带向友军。\n戴好呼吸器可大幅减少毒气累积。")},
{TEXT("毒云随风漂移，遮蔽视线并杀伤持续暴露的步兵，也会伤及友军。正确佩戴呼吸器可大幅减缓毒气累积。"),TEXT("Gas drifts with the wind, obscuring sight and harming exposed infantry on either side. Properly fitted respirators greatly slow gas accumulation."),TEXT("Gas shells burst and an alarm passes down the trench. Drifting clouds obscure sight and endanger men who remain; the wind can carry them towards friendly troops.\nA sealed respirator greatly reduces gas exposure.")},
{TEXT("毒云随风漂移，遮蔽视线并杀伤持续暴露的步兵，也会伤及友军。正确佩戴呼吸器可大幅减缓毒气累积。"),TEXT("Gas drifts with the wind, obscuring sight and harming exposed infantry on either side. Properly fitted respirators greatly slow gas accumulation."),TEXT("Gas shells burst. An alarm passes down the trench.\nDrifting clouds obscure sight and kill infantry that remain exposed, including friendly troops. A sealed respirator greatly slows gas exposure.")},

// S.5
{TEXT("野炮迅速迎击指定区域内可见的装甲，最多发射 6 发。烟幕、遮挡或目标驶离区域后，射击中断。"),TEXT("Field guns respond quickly against visible armour in the selected area, firing up to 6 rounds. Smoke, obstruction or a target leaving the area interrupts fire."),TEXT("炮口压低，炮手等着敌车进入射界。反坦克野炮打击指定地域内可见装甲；烟幕、遮挡或驶离地域都会使射击停止。\n弹药：最多6发，响应较快。")},
{TEXT("野炮迅速迎击指定区域内可见的装甲，最多发射 6 发。烟幕、遮挡或目标驶离区域后，射击中断。"),TEXT("Field guns respond quickly against visible armour in the selected area, firing up to 6 rounds. Smoke, obstruction or a target leaving the area interrupts fire."),TEXT("炮口压低，敌车进入射界。\n快速反装甲支援，最多发射 6 发，只攻击指定地域内可见的装甲。烟幕、遮挡或目标驶离会中断射击。")},
{TEXT("野炮迅速迎击指定区域内可见的装甲，最多发射 6 发。烟幕、遮挡或目标驶离区域后，射击中断。"),TEXT("Field guns respond quickly against visible armour in the selected area, firing up to 6 rounds. Smoke, obstruction or a target leaving the area interrupts fire."),TEXT("The gun is laid low as armour enters its sights.\nA quick anti-tank mission of up to 6 rounds, engaging visible armour inside the chosen sector. Smoke, cover or a target leaving the sector interrupts fire.")},
{TEXT("野炮迅速迎击指定区域内可见的装甲，最多发射 6 发。烟幕、遮挡或目标驶离区域后，射击中断。"),TEXT("Field guns respond quickly against visible armour in the selected area, firing up to 6 rounds. Smoke, obstruction or a target leaving the area interrupts fire."),TEXT("炮口压低，等待敌车进入射界。\n较快响应的反装甲火力，最多发射 6 发。仅攻击指定区域内可见的装甲；烟幕、遮挡或目标驶离会中断交战。")},
{TEXT("野炮迅速迎击指定区域内可见的装甲，最多发射 6 发。烟幕、遮挡或目标驶离区域后，射击中断。"),TEXT("Field guns respond quickly against visible armour in the selected area, firing up to 6 rounds. Smoke, obstruction or a target leaving the area interrupts fire."),TEXT("The gun is laid low for the approaching tank.\nA quick anti-armour response with up to 6 rounds. Engages visible armour inside the selected sector. Smoke, cover or a target leaving the sector interrupts fire.")},
{TEXT("野炮迅速迎击指定区域内可见的装甲，最多发射 6 发。烟幕、遮挡或目标驶离区域后，射击中断。"),TEXT("Field guns respond quickly against visible armour in the selected area, firing up to 6 rounds. Smoke, obstruction or a target leaving the area interrupts fire."),TEXT("The muzzle lowers as a tank enters the gun's field of fire. Anti-tank guns engage visible armour in the chosen sector; smoke, cover or leaving the sector stops the engagement.\nAmmunition: up to 6 rounds, with a quicker response.")},

// S.6
{TEXT("飞机进行两次低空扫射，打击航线内的暴露步兵。胸墙可挡住部分枪弹，机枪无法击穿重装甲；航线内的友军也会遭到杀伤。"),TEXT("Two low strafing passes attack exposed infantry along the flight path. Parapets block some rounds and machine guns cannot penetrate heavy armour. Friendly troops along the path are also at risk."),TEXT("双翼机低掠前沿。窄幅扫射压制暴露步兵和纵队；胸墙能挡住部分火力，重装甲抵御机枪弹。\n航线：2次通场；航线内友军也会中弹。")},
