{TEXT("飞机进行两次低空扫射，打击航线内的暴露步兵。胸墙可挡住部分枪弹，机枪无法击穿重装甲；航线内的友军也会遭到杀伤。"),TEXT("Two low strafing passes attack exposed infantry along the flight path. Parapets block some rounds and machine guns cannot penetrate heavy armour. Friendly troops along the path are also at risk."),TEXT("A biplane dips its nose over the front.\nTwo strafing passes attack exposed infantry along the flight path. Parapets offer cover and heavy armour resists the bullets. Friendly troops in the lane are also at risk.")},
{TEXT("飞机进行两次低空扫射，打击航线内的暴露步兵。胸墙可挡住部分枪弹，机枪无法击穿重装甲；航线内的友军也会遭到杀伤。"),TEXT("Two low strafing passes attack exposed infantry along the flight path. Parapets block some rounds and machine guns cannot penetrate heavy armour. Friendly troops along the path are also at risk."),TEXT("A biplane sweeps low over the front. Narrow strafing runs suppress exposed infantry and columns; parapets offer cover and heavy armour resists the bullets.\nFlight: 2 passes; friendly troops in the lane are also exposed.")},

// S.7
{TEXT("六组弹幕逐段向敌后推进，每组 3 发，持续压制沿途阵地。步兵须与弹着区保持距离，跟得过近也会被炮击。"),TEXT("Six barrage groups advance through enemy positions, with 3 shells per group. Infantry must keep clear of the impact area; following too closely exposes them to shellfire."),TEXT("步兵与炮兵对准表针。徐进弹幕逐段向敌后压制枪位；跟进过近会遭己方炮火。\n弹幕：6组，每组3发。")},
{TEXT("六组弹幕逐段向敌后推进，每组 3 发，持续压制沿途阵地。步兵须与弹着区保持距离，跟得过近也会被炮击。"),TEXT("Six barrage groups advance through enemy positions, with 3 shells per group. Infantry must keep clear of the impact area; following too closely exposes them to shellfire."),TEXT("步兵与炮兵按表针推进。\n六组弹幕，每组三发，逐段向敌后压进。连续阵位受压制；跟进过近的友军也会被炮击。")},
{TEXT("六组弹幕逐段向敌后推进，每组 3 发，持续压制沿途阵地。步兵须与弹着区保持距离，跟得过近也会被炮击。"),TEXT("Six barrage groups advance through enemy positions, with 3 shells per group. Infantry must keep clear of the impact area; following too closely exposes them to shellfire."),TEXT("Infantry and gunners advance by the watch.\nSix groups of three shells lift towards the enemy rear, suppressing successive positions. Friendly troops following too closely enter the barrage.")},
{TEXT("六组弹幕逐段向敌后推进，每组 3 发，持续压制沿途阵地。步兵须与弹着区保持距离，跟得过近也会被炮击。"),TEXT("Six barrage groups advance through enemy positions, with 3 shells per group. Infantry must keep clear of the impact area; following too closely exposes them to shellfire."),TEXT("炮兵与步兵核对最后一次表针。\n六组弹幕向敌后逐段推进，每组 3 发。压制连续阵位；跟进过近的友军也会遭到炮击。")},
{TEXT("六组弹幕逐段向敌后推进，每组 3 发，持续压制沿途阵地。步兵须与弹着区保持距离，跟得过近也会被炮击。"),TEXT("Six barrage groups advance through enemy positions, with 3 shells per group. Infantry must keep clear of the impact area; following too closely exposes them to shellfire."),TEXT("Gunners and infantry check their watches once more.\nSix groups of 3 shells move the barrage towards the enemy rear. Suppresses successive positions and endangers friendly troops following too closely.")},
{TEXT("六组弹幕逐段向敌后推进，每组 3 发，持续压制沿途阵地。步兵须与弹着区保持距离，跟得过近也会被炮击。"),TEXT("Six barrage groups advance through enemy positions, with 3 shells per group. Infantry must keep clear of the impact area; following too closely exposes them to shellfire."),TEXT("Infantry and gunners set their watches. A creeping barrage suppresses successive positions towards the enemy rear; troops following too closely meet their own shells.\nBarrage: 6 groups of 3 rounds.")},

// S.8
{TEXT("榴霰弹在目标区域上空起爆，杀伤开阔地上的密集步兵。两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信训练增加一轮。深壕与坚土可提供掩护。对坦克无效，爆区内的友军也会受伤。"),TEXT("Shrapnel bursts above the target area, striking massed infantry in the open. Each mission fires two salvos of 3 shells; fuze training adds a third. Deep trenches and earth offer protection. It is ineffective against tanks, and friendly troops in the burst area are also at risk."),TEXT("引信刻度装定，榴霰弹在空中裂开。密集行军的步兵首当其冲，深壕和坚土遮挡弹珠。\n齐射：2轮，每轮3发；引信操练增加到3轮。不能伤害坦克，友军必须避开。")},
{TEXT("榴霰弹在目标区域上空起爆，杀伤开阔地上的密集步兵。两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信训练增加一轮。深壕与坚土可提供掩护。对坦克无效，爆区内的友军也会受伤。"),TEXT("Shrapnel bursts above the target area, striking massed infantry in the open. Each mission fires two salvos of 3 shells; fuze training adds a third. Deep trenches and earth offer protection. It is ineffective against tanks, and friendly troops in the burst area are also at risk."),TEXT("Shrapnel bursts above the target area, striking massed infantry in the open. Two salvos of 3 shells; fuze training adds one salvo. Deep trenches and earth offer protection. Ineffective against tanks; friendly troops in the burst area are also at risk.")},
{TEXT("榴霰弹在目标区域上空起爆，杀伤开阔地上的密集步兵。两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信训练增加一轮。深壕与坚土可提供掩护。对坦克无效，爆区内的友军也会受伤。"),TEXT("Shrapnel bursts above the target area, striking massed infantry in the open. Each mission fires two salvos of 3 shells; fuze training adds a third. Deep trenches and earth offer protection. It is ineffective against tanks, and friendly troops in the burst area are also at risk."),TEXT("榴霰弹在胸墙上方裂开。\n两轮齐射，每轮三发；引信操练增加一轮。克制开阔地上的密集步兵，深壕与坚土提供掩护。无法损伤坦克，友军也会遭到杀伤。")},
{TEXT("榴霰弹在目标区域上空起爆，杀伤开阔地上的密集步兵。两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信训练增加一轮。深壕与坚土可提供掩护。对坦克无效，爆区内的友军也会受伤。"),TEXT("Shrapnel bursts above the target area, striking massed infantry in the open. Each mission fires two salvos of 3 shells; fuze training adds a third. Deep trenches and earth offer protection. It is ineffective against tanks, and friendly troops in the burst area are also at risk."),TEXT("Shrapnel bursts above the parapet.\nTwo salvos of three shells; fuze drill adds one salvo. Effective against massed infantry in the open. Deep trenches and earth provide cover. Cannot damage tanks; allies are also at risk.")},
{TEXT("榴霰弹在目标区域上空起爆，杀伤开阔地上的密集步兵。两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信训练增加一轮。深壕与坚土可提供掩护。对坦克无效，爆区内的友军也会受伤。"),TEXT("Shrapnel bursts above the target area, striking massed infantry in the open. Each mission fires two salvos of 3 shells; fuze training adds a third. Deep trenches and earth offer protection. It is ineffective against tanks, and friendly troops in the burst area are also at risk."),TEXT("引信装定，榴霰弹在步兵头顶裂开。\n两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信操练增至三轮。克制开阔地上的密集步兵，深壕与坚土提供保护。对坦克无效，也会杀伤友军。")},
{TEXT("榴霰弹在目标区域上空起爆，杀伤开阔地上的密集步兵。两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信训练增加一轮。深壕与坚土可提供掩护。对坦克无效，爆区内的友军也会受伤。"),TEXT("Shrapnel bursts above the target area, striking massed infantry in the open. Each mission fires two salvos of 3 shells; fuze training adds a third. Deep trenches and earth offer protection. It is ineffective against tanks, and friendly troops in the burst area are also at risk."),TEXT("Fuzes are set and shells split overhead. Shrapnel punishes infantry crowded in the open; deep trenches and earth screen the balls.\nSalvo: two groups of three, rising to three groups with fuze drill. Cannot damage tanks. Keep friendlies clear.")},
{TEXT("榴霰弹在目标区域上空起爆，杀伤开阔地上的密集步兵。两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信训练增加一轮。深壕与坚土可提供掩护。对坦克无效，爆区内的友军也会受伤。"),TEXT("Shrapnel bursts above the target area, striking massed infantry in the open. Each mission fires two salvos of 3 shells; fuze training adds a third. Deep trenches and earth offer protection. It is ineffective against tanks, and friendly troops in the burst area are also at risk."),TEXT("Fuzes are set. Shrapnel bursts above the infantry.\nTwo salvos of 3 shells, increased to three salvos by fuze drill. Effective against crowded infantry in the open; deep trenches and earth give protection. Harms allies and cannot damage tanks.")},

// S.9
