{TEXT("12 枚炸弹沿选定航线落下，适合打击固定阵地和集结部队。接令后航线固定，不会追踪移动目标；友军须避开轰炸带。"),TEXT("12 bombs fall along the selected flight path, suited to fixed positions and massed troops. The path is fixed when ordered and does not track moving targets. Keep friendly troops clear of the bombing lane."),TEXT("Bombs leave the racks along the flight path. Bombing covers the chosen ground, threatening concentrations and fixed positions; the aircraft follows its committed run, which friendly troops must clear.\nAmmunition: 12 bombs.")},

