// B.T10
{TEXT("军士或军官停稳 2 秒，目标可见且有同组士兵在旁时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，缩短首轮等待并减少散布。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。"),TEXT("A command section halted for two seconds with a surviving companion and a clear view can register artillery and mortars, bringing the first salvo sooner with less scatter. Movement, smoke, obstruction or loss of the companion interrupts registration. Marksmen can still report visible targets."),TEXT("观察员报出地标，传令兵送回修正。\n指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布缩小 30%。\n移动、遮挡、烟雾或失去同伴会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。")},
{TEXT("军士或军官停稳 2 秒，目标可见且有同组士兵在旁时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，缩短首轮等待并减少散布。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。"),TEXT("A command section halted for two seconds with a surviving companion and a clear view can register artillery and mortars, bringing the first salvo sooner with less scatter. Movement, smoke, obstruction or loss of the companion interrupts registration. Marksmen can still report visible targets."),TEXT("观察员报出地标，炮位修正诸元。\n有同伴掩护、视野清楚的指挥官，停步校射后可缩短炮击首轮等待，并收紧散布。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴都会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。")},
{TEXT("军士或军官停稳 2 秒，目标可见且有同组士兵在旁时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，缩短首轮等待并减少散布。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。"),TEXT("A command section halted for two seconds with a surviving companion and a clear view can register artillery and mortars, bringing the first salvo sooner with less scatter. Movement, smoke, obstruction or loss of the companion interrupts registration. Marksmen can still report visible targets."),TEXT("The observer reports a landmark; the battery corrects its aim.\nA halted commander with an escort and a clear view brings the first artillery or mortar salvo sooner, with tighter scatter. Movement, smoke, cover or loss of the escort interrupts correction. Marksmen can still report visible targets.")},
{TEXT("军士或军官停稳 2 秒，目标可见且有同组士兵在旁时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，缩短首轮等待并减少散布。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。"),TEXT("A command section halted for two seconds with a surviving companion and a clear view can register artillery and mortars, bringing the first salvo sooner with less scatter. Movement, smoke, obstruction or loss of the companion interrupts registration. Marksmen can still report visible targets."),TEXT("观察员指认地标，传令兵记下方位。\n战术：指挥组携一名存活伴随兵停稳两秒，并看清目标时，野炮与迫击炮首轮提早2.5秒、散布缩小30%。烟雾、遮挡、移动或失去伴随兵会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。")},
{TEXT("军士或军官停稳 2 秒，目标可见且有同组士兵在旁时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，缩短首轮等待并减少散布。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。"),TEXT("A command section halted for two seconds with a surviving companion and a clear view can register artillery and mortars, bringing the first salvo sooner with less scatter. Movement, smoke, obstruction or loss of the companion interrupts registration. Marksmen can still report visible targets."),TEXT("A landmark is sighted and a correction sent back.\nWith a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with 30% less scatter.\nMovement, cover, smoke or loss of the escort interrupts correction. Marksmen retain their target reports.")},
{TEXT("军士或军官停稳 2 秒，目标可见且有同组士兵在旁时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，缩短首轮等待并减少散布。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。"),TEXT("A command section halted for two seconds with a surviving companion and a clear view can register artillery and mortars, bringing the first salvo sooner with less scatter. Movement, smoke, obstruction or loss of the companion interrupts registration. Marksmen can still report visible targets."),TEXT("An observer points out a landmark and a runner notes the bearing.\nTactics: A commander halted for two seconds with a living escort brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds earlier with 30% less scatter, provided he can see the target. Smoke, obstruction, movement or loss of the escort interrupts correction. Marksmen retain their early target reports.")},

// G.T10
{TEXT("迫击炮散布缩小。军士或军官停稳 2 秒，目标可见且有同组士兵在旁时，可进一步缩短野炮和迫击炮的首轮等待，提高炮击精度。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴会中断校射。"),TEXT("Reduces mortar scatter. A command section halted for two seconds with a surviving companion and a clear view can further shorten the first artillery or mortar salvo delay and improve accuracy. Movement, smoke, obstruction or loss of the companion interrupts registration."),TEXT("新坐标记入炮兵测地表。\n迫击炮散布缩小。指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮另提前 2.5 秒，散布再缩小 30%。\n移动、遮挡、烟雾或失去同伴会中断校射。")},
{TEXT("迫击炮散布缩小。军士或军官停稳 2 秒，目标可见且有同组士兵在旁时，可进一步缩短野炮和迫击炮的首轮等待，提高炮击精度。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴会中断校射。"),TEXT("Reduces mortar scatter. A command section halted for two seconds with a surviving companion and a clear view can further shorten the first artillery or mortar salvo delay and improve accuracy. Movement, smoke, obstruction or loss of the companion interrupts registration."),TEXT("炮兵把新坐标填进测地表。\n收紧迫击炮散布。有同伴掩护、视野清楚的指挥官，停步校射后可进一步缩短首轮等待、改善炮群精度。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴都会中断校射。")},
{TEXT("迫击炮散布缩小。军士或军官停稳 2 秒，目标可见且有同组士兵在旁时，可进一步缩短野炮和迫击炮的首轮等待，提高炮击精度。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴会中断校射。"),TEXT("Reduces mortar scatter. A command section halted for two seconds with a surviving companion and a clear view can further shorten the first artillery or mortar salvo delay and improve accuracy. Movement, smoke, obstruction or loss of the companion interrupts registration."),TEXT("The battery enters new coordinates on its survey sheet.\nTightens mortar scatter. A halted commander with an escort and a clear view brings the first salvo sooner and further improves the battery’s accuracy. Movement, smoke, cover or loss of the escort interrupts correction.")},
{TEXT("迫击炮散布缩小。军士或军官停稳 2 秒，目标可见且有同组士兵在旁时，可进一步缩短野炮和迫击炮的首轮等待，提高炮击精度。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴会中断校射。"),TEXT("Reduces mortar scatter. A command section halted for two seconds with a surviving companion and a clear view can further shorten the first artillery or mortar salvo delay and improve accuracy. Movement, smoke, obstruction or loss of the companion interrupts registration."),TEXT("炮位测地表添上前沿的新坐标。\n战术：缩小迫击炮散布。指挥组携存活伴随兵停稳两秒并看清目标时，野炮与迫击炮首轮另提早2.5秒、散布缩小30%；烟雾、遮挡、移动或失去伴随兵会中断校射。")},
{TEXT("迫击炮散布缩小。军士或军官停稳 2 秒，目标可见且有同组士兵在旁时，可进一步缩短野炮和迫击炮的首轮等待，提高炮击精度。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴会中断校射。"),TEXT("Reduces mortar scatter. A command section halted for two seconds with a surviving companion and a clear view can further shorten the first artillery or mortar salvo delay and improve accuracy. Movement, smoke, obstruction or loss of the companion interrupts registration."),TEXT("Fresh front-line coordinates are entered on the battery survey.\nTactics: Tightens mortar scatter. A commander halted for two seconds with a living escort brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds earlier with 30% less scatter if the target is visible. Smoke, obstruction, movement or loss of the escort interrupts correction.")},
{TEXT("迫击炮散布缩小。军士或军官停稳 2 秒，目标可见且有同组士兵在旁时，可进一步缩短野炮和迫击炮的首轮等待，提高炮击精度。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴会中断校射。"),TEXT("Reduces mortar scatter. A command section halted for two seconds with a surviving companion and a clear view can further shorten the first artillery or mortar salvo delay and improve accuracy. Movement, smoke, obstruction or loss of the companion interrupts registration."),TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey.\nMortar scatter tightens. With a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with a further 30% less scatter.\nMovement, cover, smoke or loss of the escort interrupts correction.")},

// T.16
{TEXT("为投弹班、工兵和喷火组配发呼吸器。正确佩戴后，毒气累积降低 78%；仍会受到压制，长期暴露仍可能致命。其余分队没有防毒装备。"),TEXT("Equips bombers, pioneers and flame troops with respirators. A proper fit reduces gas accumulation by 78%; suppression remains and prolonged exposure can still kill. Other sections receive no gas protection."),TEXT("滤盒卸下补给车，面具逐一检查。\n战术：为突击班、工兵和喷火分遣队配发经气密检查的呼吸器；佩戴完成后减少 78% 毒气累积，仍会受压制，久留仍有危险。其他分队必须绕开或撤出毒区。")},
{TEXT("为投弹班、工兵和喷火组配发呼吸器。正确佩戴后，毒气累积降低 78%；仍会受到压制，长期暴露仍可能致命。其余分队没有防毒装备。"),TEXT("Equips bombers, pioneers and flame troops with respirators. A proper fit reduces gas accumulation by 78%; suppression remains and prolonged exposure can still kill. Other sections receive no gas protection."),TEXT("滤盒与面罩发到前沿分遣队。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火组获得呼吸器。密封佩戴后，毒气累积降低 78%；压制仍在，长时间暴露仍可能致命。其余分队没有防毒装备。")},
{TEXT("为投弹班、工兵和喷火组配发呼吸器。正确佩戴后，毒气累积降低 78%；仍会受到压制，长期暴露仍可能致命。其余分队没有防毒装备。"),TEXT("Equips bombers, pioneers and flame troops with respirators. A proper fit reduces gas accumulation by 78%; suppression remains and prolonged exposure can still kill. Other sections receive no gas protection."),TEXT("Filters and facepieces reach the forward detachments.\nIssues respirators to bombers, pioneers and flame troops. Once sealed, gas exposure falls by 78%. Suppression remains and prolonged exposure can still kill. Other sections have no respirators.")},
{TEXT("为投弹班、工兵和喷火组配发呼吸器。正确佩戴后，毒气累积降低 78%；仍会受到压制，长期暴露仍可能致命。其余分队没有防毒装备。"),TEXT("Equips bombers, pioneers and flame troops with respirators. A proper fit reduces gas accumulation by 78%; suppression remains and prolonged exposure can still kill. Other sections receive no gas protection."),TEXT("滤盒离开补给车，面罩逐一检查气密。\n为投弹班、工兵与喷火分遣队配发呼吸器。完成佩戴后，毒气累积减少 78%；仍受压制，久留仍可能致命。其余分队需避开毒区。")},
{TEXT("为投弹班、工兵和喷火组配发呼吸器。正确佩戴后，毒气累积降低 78%；仍会受到压制，长期暴露仍可能致命。其余分队没有防毒装备。"),TEXT("Equips bombers, pioneers and flame troops with respirators. A proper fit reduces gas accumulation by 78%; suppression remains and prolonged exposure can still kill. Other sections receive no gas protection."),TEXT("Filter boxes leave the supply wagon and each mask is checked.\nTactics: Issues checked respirators to bombers, pioneers and flame detachments. A completed seal reduces gas exposure by 78%; suppression and prolonged exposure remain dangerous. Other sections must avoid or leave the cloud.")},
{TEXT("为投弹班、工兵和喷火组配发呼吸器。正确佩戴后，毒气累积降低 78%；仍会受到压制，长期暴露仍可能致命。其余分队没有防毒装备。"),TEXT("Equips bombers, pioneers and flame troops with respirators. A proper fit reduces gas accumulation by 78%; suppression remains and prolonged exposure can still kill. Other sections receive no gas protection."),TEXT("Filters are unloaded and each facepiece tested.\nIssues respirators to bombers, pioneers and flame detachments. Once sealed, gas exposure falls by 78%. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure can still kill. Other sections must avoid the cloud.")},

// T.18
{TEXT("喷火射程略增；首罐燃料耗尽后，可再喷射 4 次。"),TEXT("Slightly extends flame range and adds 4 bursts after the first fuel tank runs out."),TEXT("备用燃料从交通壕送到喷火组。\n喷火射程略增；首次燃料耗尽后，可再喷射四次。")},
{TEXT("喷火射程略增；首罐燃料耗尽后，可再喷射 4 次。"),TEXT("Slightly extends flame range and adds 4 bursts after the first fuel tank runs out."),TEXT("备用燃料沿交通壕送到。\n喷火射程略增；首罐耗尽后增加四次喷射。")},
{TEXT("喷火射程略增；首罐燃料耗尽后，可再喷射 4 次。"),TEXT("Slightly extends flame range and adds 4 bursts after the first fuel tank runs out."),TEXT("Reserve fuel arrives through the communication trench.\nFlame reach increases modestly; four further bursts remain after the first reservoir is exhausted.")},
{TEXT("喷火射程略增；首罐燃料耗尽后，可再喷射 4 次。"),TEXT("Slightly extends flame range and adds 4 bursts after the first fuel tank runs out."),TEXT("备用燃料沿交通壕送来。\n战术：喷火射程略增，首次用尽燃料后追加四次喷射。")},
{TEXT("喷火射程略增；首罐燃料耗尽后，可再喷射 4 次。"),TEXT("Slightly extends flame range and adds 4 bursts after the first fuel tank runs out."),TEXT("Reserve fuel comes up the communication trench.\nTactics: Flame reach increases modestly, with four additional bursts after the first reservoir is exhausted.")},
{TEXT("喷火射程略增；首罐燃料耗尽后，可再喷射 4 次。"),TEXT("Slightly extends flame range and adds 4 bursts after the first fuel tank runs out."),TEXT("Reserve fuel reaches the flame party along the trench.\nFlame reach increases modestly. Four more bursts become available after the first reservoir is exhausted.")},

// T.21
{TEXT("己方士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹与航空轰炸的整备时间缩短 22%。"),TEXT("Below 35 friendly morale, creeping barrage, shrapnel and aerial bombing readiness time is reduced by 22%."),TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。\n己方士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹与轰炸任务整备缩短 22%。")},
{TEXT("己方士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹与航空轰炸的整备时间缩短 22%。"),TEXT("Below 35 friendly morale, creeping barrage, shrapnel and aerial bombing readiness time is reduced by 22%."),TEXT("求援信号升起，预备弹药启封。\n士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹与轰炸整备时间缩短 22%。")},
{TEXT("己方士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹与航空轰炸的整备时间缩短 22%。"),TEXT("Below 35 friendly morale, creeping barrage, shrapnel and aerial bombing readiness time is reduced by 22%."),TEXT("A distress signal releases the reserve ammunition.\nBelow 35 morale, creeping barrages, shrapnel and bombing missions prepare 22% sooner.")},
{TEXT("己方士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹与航空轰炸的整备时间缩短 22%。"),TEXT("Below 35 friendly morale, creeping barrage, shrapnel and aerial bombing readiness time is reduced by 22%."),TEXT("连部启封最后一批预备弹药。\n战术：己方士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹齐射和投弹任务的整备缩短 22%。")},
{TEXT("己方士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹与航空轰炸的整备时间缩短 22%。"),TEXT("Below 35 friendly morale, creeping barrage, shrapnel and aerial bombing readiness time is reduced by 22%."),TEXT("A distress signal rises. The reserve ammunition is opened.\nBelow 35 morale, creeping barrages, shrapnel salvos and bombing missions prepare 22% sooner.")},
{TEXT("己方士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹与航空轰炸的整备时间缩短 22%。"),TEXT("Below 35 friendly morale, creeping barrage, shrapnel and aerial bombing readiness time is reduced by 22%."),TEXT("Headquarters opens the reserve ammunition stores.\nTactics: Below 35 morale, creeping barrages, shrapnel salvos and bombing missions prepare 22% sooner.")},

// T.25
{TEXT("同队携弹手存活且在专门射手附近时，装填时间缩短 15%。"),TEXT("A surviving bearer near the specialist gunner reduces reload time by 15%."),TEXT("携弹手把下一发递到射手身旁。\n本组携弹手在旁协助时，专门武器装填时间缩短15%。")},
{TEXT("同队携弹手存活且在专门射手附近时，装填时间缩短 15%。"),TEXT("A surviving bearer near the specialist gunner reduces reload time by 15%."),TEXT("携弹手守在射手身旁。\n存活的同队携弹手在附近时，专门武器装填时间缩短 15%。")},
{TEXT("同队携弹手存活且在专门射手附近时，装填时间缩短 15%。"),TEXT("A surviving bearer near the specialist gunner reduces reload time by 15%."),TEXT("The bearer keeps the next round beside the gunner.\nSpecialist weapons have 15% shorter reload times while a living squadmate is nearby.")},
{TEXT("同队携弹手存活且在专门射手附近时，装填时间缩短 15%。"),TEXT("A surviving bearer near the specialist gunner reduces reload time by 15%."),TEXT("携弹手把下一发递到枪手身旁。\n战术：专门射手附近有存活的同队携弹手时，装填时间缩短 15%。")},
{TEXT("同队携弹手存活且在专门射手附近时，装填时间缩短 15%。"),TEXT("A surviving bearer near the specialist gunner reduces reload time by 15%."),TEXT("携弹手把下一发递到枪托旁。\n专门射手附近有存活的同队携弹手时，装填时间缩短 15%。")},
{TEXT("同队携弹手存活且在专门射手附近时，装填时间缩短 15%。"),TEXT("A surviving bearer near the specialist gunner reduces reload time by 15%."),TEXT("A bearer places the next round beside the gunner.\nTactics: Specialist weapons reload 15% faster while a living squadmate remains nearby.")},
{TEXT("同队携弹手存活且在专门射手附近时，装填时间缩短 15%。"),TEXT("A surviving bearer near the specialist gunner reduces reload time by 15%."),TEXT("The bearer passes the next round to the gunner.\nSpecialist weapons have 15% shorter reload times while their bearer is nearby.")},
{TEXT("同队携弹手存活且在专门射手附近时，装填时间缩短 15%。"),TEXT("A surviving bearer near the specialist gunner reduces reload time by 15%."),TEXT("The next round reaches the gunner's shoulder.\nSpecialist weapons reload 15% faster while a living squadmate remains nearby.")},

// T.27
{TEXT("解锁伴随机枪组：移动更快，架设与收枪快 30%，射程与压制弱于固定枪组。\n可在整备页切换编制，共用槽位和整备，仅影响后续征募。"),TEXT("Unlocks mobile gun sections: faster movement, deployment and packing 30% quicker, with shorter range and weaker suppression than fixed crews.\nSwitch formation on the preparation page; both share a slot and readiness, and changes affect future recruits."),TEXT("枪械与弹药分给更多携行手。\n解锁伴随机枪编组：移动较快，架设与收枪快 30%，射程与压制较弱。\n在整备页与固定枪组互换，共用岗位和整备；只影响之后征募的分队。")},
{TEXT("解锁伴随机枪组：移动更快，架设与收枪快 30%，射程与压制弱于固定枪组。\n可在整备页切换编制，共用槽位和整备，仅影响后续征募。"),TEXT("Unlocks mobile gun sections: faster movement, deployment and packing 30% quicker, with shorter range and weaker suppression than fixed crews.\nSwitch formation on the preparation page; both share a slot and readiness, and changes affect future recruits."),TEXT("携行手分担枪械与弹药。\n解锁伴随机枪组：移动更快，架设与收枪快 30%，射程与压制较弱。\n整备页可与固定枪组互换，共用槽位和整备，只影响之后征募的分队。")},
{TEXT("解锁伴随机枪组：移动更快，架设与收枪快 30%，射程与压制弱于固定枪组。\n可在整备页切换编制，共用槽位和整备，仅影响后续征募。"),TEXT("Unlocks mobile gun sections: faster movement, deployment and packing 30% quicker, with shorter range and weaker suppression than fixed crews.\nSwitch formation on the preparation page; both share a slot and readiness, and changes affect future recruits."),TEXT("Bearers share the gun and ammunition.\nUnlocks a mobile gun section: faster movement and 30% faster deployment and packing, with less range and suppression.\nExchange it with the fixed section in the loadout. Both share a slot and readiness; only new recruits receive the change.")},
