// Manual.Objective
{TEXT("清除敌军后方防区的守军，让一支小队的全部生还者或整辆战车越过后方交通线，即可获胜。击溃敌军士气也可取胜。\n\n友军误伤、毒气和近距离敌方装甲会削弱士气；占壕、推进与部队相互支援可恢复少量士气。"),TEXT("Clear the enemy rear sector and bring every survivor of one section or an entire vehicle across the rear communications line to win. Breaking enemy morale also wins.\n\nFriendly fire, gas and nearby enemy armour reduce morale. Capturing trenches, advancing and mutual support restore a little."),TEXT("清除敌方末端防区，让一支小队的全部生还者或整辆战车穿过后方交通线，即可获胜。击溃敌军士气也能取胜。己方炮火、毒气与近距离装甲会动摇士气；占壕、推进和相互支援可恢复少量士气。")},
{TEXT("清除敌军后方防区的守军，让一支小队的全部生还者或整辆战车越过后方交通线，即可获胜。击溃敌军士气也可取胜。\n\n友军误伤、毒气和近距离敌方装甲会削弱士气；占壕、推进与部队相互支援可恢复少量士气。"),TEXT("Clear the enemy rear sector and bring every survivor of one section or an entire vehicle across the rear communications line to win. Breaking enemy morale also wins.\n\nFriendly fire, gas and nearby enemy armour reduce morale. Capturing trenches, advancing and mutual support restore a little."),TEXT("肃清敌军后沿防区，以一支小队的全部生还者或整辆战车突破阵地尽头。击溃敌军士气也可取胜。\n\n友军误伤、毒气和近距离敌方装甲削弱士气；占壕、推进与部队相互支援可恢复少量士气。")},
{TEXT("清除敌军后方防区的守军，让一支小队的全部生还者或整辆战车越过后方交通线，即可获胜。击溃敌军士气也可取胜。\n\n友军误伤、毒气和近距离敌方装甲会削弱士气；占壕、推进与部队相互支援可恢复少量士气。"),TEXT("Clear the enemy rear sector and bring every survivor of one section or an entire vehicle across the rear communications line to win. Breaking enemy morale also wins.\n\nFriendly fire, gas and nearby enemy armour reduce morale. Capturing trenches, advancing and mutual support restore a little."),TEXT("Clear the enemy rear sector, then bring every survivor of one section or an entire tank beyond the rear boundary. Breaking enemy morale also wins.\n\nFriendly fire, gas and nearby enemy armour reduce morale. Capturing trenches, advancing and mutual support restore a little.")},
{TEXT("清除敌军后方防区的守军，让一支小队的全部生还者或整辆战车越过后方交通线，即可获胜。击溃敌军士气也可取胜。\n\n友军误伤、毒气和近距离敌方装甲会削弱士气；占壕、推进与部队相互支援可恢复少量士气。"),TEXT("Clear the enemy rear sector and bring every survivor of one section or an entire vehicle across the rear communications line to win. Breaking enemy morale also wins.\n\nFriendly fire, gas and nearby enemy armour reduce morale. Capturing trenches, advancing and mutual support restore a little."),TEXT("清除最后一道敌壕及后沿的守军，让整支小队的生还者或整辆战车突破后方交通线。零散越线不能绕过末端守军。击溃敌军士气也能取胜。友军误伤、毒气和装甲威胁动摇士气；推进与互相支援恢复信心。")},
{TEXT("清除敌军后方防区的守军，让一支小队的全部生还者或整辆战车越过后方交通线，即可获胜。击溃敌军士气也可取胜。\n\n友军误伤、毒气和近距离敌方装甲会削弱士气；占壕、推进与部队相互支援可恢复少量士气。"),TEXT("Clear the enemy rear sector and bring every survivor of one section or an entire vehicle across the rear communications line to win. Breaking enemy morale also wins.\n\nFriendly fire, gas and nearby enemy armour reduce morale. Capturing trenches, advancing and mutual support restore a little."),TEXT("越过最后一道敌壕后，继续突破敌军后方交通线；占壕本身不会结束战斗。迫使敌军士气崩溃也能取胜。友军误伤、毒气和装甲威胁动摇士气；攻克阵地、推进与互相支援会恢复少量信心。")},
{TEXT("清除敌军后方防区的守军，让一支小队的全部生还者或整辆战车越过后方交通线，即可获胜。击溃敌军士气也可取胜。\n\n友军误伤、毒气和近距离敌方装甲会削弱士气；占壕、推进与部队相互支援可恢复少量士气。"),TEXT("Clear the enemy rear sector and bring every survivor of one section or an entire vehicle across the rear communications line to win. Breaking enemy morale also wins.\n\nFriendly fire, gas and nearby enemy armour reduce morale. Capturing trenches, advancing and mutual support restore a little."),TEXT("After the last enemy trench, push through the rear communications line; trench occupation alone does not end the battle. Breaking enemy morale also wins. Friendly shellfire, gas and armour shake morale; captured ground, an advance and mutual support restore some confidence.")},
{TEXT("清除敌军后方防区的守军，让一支小队的全部生还者或整辆战车越过后方交通线，即可获胜。击溃敌军士气也可取胜。\n\n友军误伤、毒气和近距离敌方装甲会削弱士气；占壕、推进与部队相互支援可恢复少量士气。"),TEXT("Clear the enemy rear sector and bring every survivor of one section or an entire vehicle across the rear communications line to win. Breaking enemy morale also wins.\n\nFriendly fire, gas and nearby enemy armour reduce morale. Capturing trenches, advancing and mutual support restore a little."),TEXT("Clear the enemy rear sector, then bring every survivor of a section or an entire vehicle through the rear line to win. Breaking enemy morale also wins. Friendly shellfire, gas and nearby armour shake morale; captured trenches, advances and mutual support restore a little.")},
{TEXT("清除敌军后方防区的守军，让一支小队的全部生还者或整辆战车越过后方交通线，即可获胜。击溃敌军士气也可取胜。\n\n友军误伤、毒气和近距离敌方装甲会削弱士气；占壕、推进与部队相互支援可恢复少量士气。"),TEXT("Clear the enemy rear sector and bring every survivor of one section or an entire vehicle across the rear communications line to win. Breaking enemy morale also wins.\n\nFriendly fire, gas and nearby enemy armour reduce morale. Capturing trenches, advancing and mutual support restore a little."),TEXT("Clear the last enemy trench and its rear approaches, then bring every survivor of a section or the whole vehicle through the rear line. Crossing alone cannot bypass the rear guard. Breaking enemy morale also wins. Friendly shellfire, gas and armour shake morale; an advance and mutual support restore confidence.")},

