// Manual.Support
{TEXT("选择支援，再标记目标区域。各项支援独立整备，传令后抵达。炮弹、毒气和扫射也会杀伤友军；烟幕遮蔽双方视线，炮弹仍可穿过。"),TEXT("Select support, then mark the target area. Support types prepare independently and arrive after the order is relayed. Shells, gas and strafing harm friendly troops too. Smoke obscures both armies; shells can still pass through."),TEXT("选择支援，再标记目标地域；炮火经过传令后抵达。野炮、烟幕与迫击炮分别整备。炮弹、毒气和扫射也会伤及友军；烟幕遮挡双方观察，无法挡住炮弹。")},
{TEXT("选择支援，再标记目标区域。各项支援独立整备，传令后抵达。炮弹、毒气和扫射也会杀伤友军；烟幕遮蔽双方视线，炮弹仍可穿过。"),TEXT("Select support, then mark the target area. Support types prepare independently and arrive after the order is relayed. Shells, gas and strafing harm friendly troops too. Smoke obscures both armies; shells can still pass through."),TEXT("选择支援并标记目标地域。各项支援独立整备，火力经传令后抵达。炮弹、毒气和扫射可杀伤友军。烟幕遮住双方视线，炮弹仍可穿过。")},
{TEXT("选择支援，再标记目标区域。各项支援独立整备，传令后抵达。炮弹、毒气和扫射也会杀伤友军；烟幕遮蔽双方视线，炮弹仍可穿过。"),TEXT("Select support, then mark the target area. Support types prepare independently and arrive after the order is relayed. Shells, gas and strafing harm friendly troops too. Smoke obscures both armies; shells can still pass through."),TEXT("Select support and mark the target area. Missions prepare separately; fire arrives after the order is relayed. Shells, gas and strafing can kill allies. Smoke obscures both armies; shells pass through it.")},
{TEXT("选择支援，再标记目标区域。各项支援独立整备，传令后抵达。炮弹、毒气和扫射也会杀伤友军；烟幕遮蔽双方视线，炮弹仍可穿过。"),TEXT("Select support, then mark the target area. Support types prepare independently and arrive after the order is relayed. Shells, gas and strafing harm friendly troops too. Smoke obscures both armies; shells can still pass through."),TEXT("Select support, then mark its target area; fire arrives after the order is relayed. Artillery, smoke and mortars prepare separately. Shells, gas and strafing also harm friendly troops. Smoke obscures both sides' sight but does not stop shells.")},

// HDR.Peak
{TEXT("峰值亮度：%.0f nit。\n以屏幕或 Windows HDR 校准结果为起点，调至亮块中的十字刚好消失。若屏幕自行压缩高光，沿用已校准峰值。\n范围 200–4000 nit；步长 50 nit。"),TEXT("Peak luminance: %.0f nits.\nStart with the display or Windows HDR calibration, then adjust until the cross in the bright patch just disappears. If the display compresses highlights, keep its calibrated peak.\n200–4000 nits; 50-nit steps."),TEXT("峰值亮度：%.0f nit。\n\n以显示器或 Windows HDR 校准结果为起点，调整到亮块中的十字刚好消失。若屏幕持续保留十字，使用已校准的峰值。\n\n范围：200–4000 nit。步进：50 nit。")},
{TEXT("峰值亮度：%.0f nit。\n以屏幕或 Windows HDR 校准结果为起点，调至亮块中的十字刚好消失。若屏幕自行压缩高光，沿用已校准峰值。\n范围 200–4000 nit；步长 50 nit。"),TEXT("Peak luminance: %.0f nits.\nStart with the display or Windows HDR calibration, then adjust until the cross in the bright patch just disappears. If the display compresses highlights, keep its calibrated peak.\n200–4000 nits; 50-nit steps."),TEXT("当前 %.0f nit，是游戏最亮高光的显示目标。1 nit = 1 cd/m²。\n\n保持平时的屏幕亮度和局部调光设置，以显示器或系统 HDR 校准的峰值起步。左侧亮块的十字比背景暗 10%%；逐步调到十字刚好消失。若始终可见，屏幕可能在映射亮部，请沿用已校准的峰值，不必一直推高。\n\n200–4000 nit；每次调整 50 nit。")},
{TEXT("峰值亮度：%.0f nit。\n以屏幕或 Windows HDR 校准结果为起点，调至亮块中的十字刚好消失。若屏幕自行压缩高光，沿用已校准峰值。\n范围 200–4000 nit；步长 50 nit。"),TEXT("Peak luminance: %.0f nits.\nStart with the display or Windows HDR calibration, then adjust until the cross in the bright patch just disappears. If the display compresses highlights, keep its calibrated peak.\n200–4000 nits; 50-nit steps."),TEXT("Currently %.0f nits: the target for the brightest highlights. 1 nit = 1 cd/m².\n\nKeep your usual display brightness and local dimming. Start with the peak established by your display or Windows HDR calibration. The cross in the bright patch is 10%% darker than its background; adjust until it just disappears. If it stays visible, your display may be tone-mapping highlights. Keep the calibrated peak instead of raising it indefinitely.\n\n200–4000 nits; 50-nit steps.")},
{TEXT("峰值亮度：%.0f nit。\n以屏幕或 Windows HDR 校准结果为起点，调至亮块中的十字刚好消失。若屏幕自行压缩高光，沿用已校准峰值。\n范围 200–4000 nit；步长 50 nit。"),TEXT("Peak luminance: %.0f nits.\nStart with the display or Windows HDR calibration, then adjust until the cross in the bright patch just disappears. If the display compresses highlights, keep its calibrated peak.\n200–4000 nits; 50-nit steps."),TEXT("Peak luminance: %.0f nits.\n\nStart with your display or Windows HDR calibration value. Adjust until the cross in the bright patch just disappears. If the display keeps the cross visible, retain its calibrated peak.\n\nRange: 200–4000 nits. Step: 50 nits.")},

// HDR.PaperWhite
{TEXT("纸白亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n普通白色与漫反射亮度。白色应舒适，十字保持可辨。\n自动值跟随当前屏幕的 Windows 白亮度，读取失败时为 203 nit；手动值按屏幕保存。\n范围 80–1000 nit，最高为峰值的 80%%；步长 10 nit。"),TEXT("Paper white: %.0f nits. %s\nSets ordinary white and diffuse brightness. White should feel comfortable and the cross remain visible.\nAutomatic mode uses this display's Windows white luminance, or 203 nits when unavailable. Manual values are saved per display.\n80–1000 nits, capped at 80%% of peak; 10-nit steps."),TEXT("当前 %.0f nit，决定普通白色和漫反射物体的亮度基准，不是火光的最高亮度。%s\n\n默认跟随当前屏幕的 Windows 白亮度，无法读取时使用 203 nit。峰值亮度不能代替纸白。手动调整后会为这块屏幕保留，恢复推荐值可再次跟随系统。\n\n白色应自然舒适，块内十字应能分辨，不要以让它消失为目标。80–1000 nit，最高为屏幕峰值的 80%%；每次调整 10 nit。")},
{TEXT("纸白亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n普通白色与漫反射亮度。白色应舒适，十字保持可辨。\n自动值跟随当前屏幕的 Windows 白亮度，读取失败时为 203 nit；手动值按屏幕保存。\n范围 80–1000 nit，最高为峰值的 80%%；步长 10 nit。"),TEXT("Paper white: %.0f nits. %s\nSets ordinary white and diffuse brightness. White should feel comfortable and the cross remain visible.\nAutomatic mode uses this display's Windows white luminance, or 203 nits when unavailable. Manual values are saved per display.\n80–1000 nits, capped at 80%% of peak; 10-nit steps."),TEXT("纸白亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n\n控制普通白色与漫反射表面的亮度。调至白色舒适、十字清晰可辨。\n\n自动值跟随当前屏幕的 Windows 白亮度；无可用数据时为 203 nit。手动值按屏幕保存。\n\n范围：80–1000 nit，上限为屏幕峰值的 80%%。步进：10 nit。")},
{TEXT("纸白亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n普通白色与漫反射亮度。白色应舒适，十字保持可辨。\n自动值跟随当前屏幕的 Windows 白亮度，读取失败时为 203 nit；手动值按屏幕保存。\n范围 80–1000 nit，最高为峰值的 80%%；步长 10 nit。"),TEXT("Paper white: %.0f nits. %s\nSets ordinary white and diffuse brightness. White should feel comfortable and the cross remain visible.\nAutomatic mode uses this display's Windows white luminance, or 203 nits when unavailable. Manual values are saved per display.\n80–1000 nits, capped at 80%% of peak; 10-nit steps."),TEXT("Currently %.0f nits: the reference brightness for ordinary white and diffuse surfaces, not the peak of flames. %s\n\nAutomatic mode follows this display's Windows white level, using 203 nits when unavailable. Peak brightness cannot replace paper white. Manual values are remembered for each display; restore recommendations to follow Windows again.\n\nWhite should look natural and comfortable, with the cross still distinguishable. Do not try to make it disappear. 80–1000 nits, limited to 80%% of display peak; 10-nit steps.")},
{TEXT("纸白亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n普通白色与漫反射亮度。白色应舒适，十字保持可辨。\n自动值跟随当前屏幕的 Windows 白亮度，读取失败时为 203 nit；手动值按屏幕保存。\n范围 80–1000 nit，最高为峰值的 80%%；步长 10 nit。"),TEXT("Paper white: %.0f nits. %s\nSets ordinary white and diffuse brightness. White should feel comfortable and the cross remain visible.\nAutomatic mode uses this display's Windows white luminance, or 203 nits when unavailable. Manual values are saved per display.\n80–1000 nits, capped at 80%% of peak; 10-nit steps."),TEXT("Paper white: %.0f nits. %s\n\nSets the brightness of ordinary white and diffuse surfaces. Choose a comfortable white with the cross clearly visible.\n\nAutomatic values follow Windows white luminance for this display, or 203 nits when unavailable. Manual settings are saved per display.\n\nRange: 80–1000 nits, capped at 80%% of display peak. Step: 10 nits.")},

// HDR.Interface
{TEXT("界面亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n控制文字、照片与操作台的亮度。以文字清楚、亮边柔和为准；仅作用于界面。\n自动值跟随 Windows 白亮度，读取失败时为 203 nit；手动值按屏幕保存。\n范围 80–1000 nit，最高为峰值的 80%%；步长 10 nit。"),TEXT("Interface luminance: %.0f nits. %s\nSets text, photographs and console brightness. Keep lettering clear and bright edges comfortable. Applies to the interface only.\nAutomatic mode uses Windows white luminance, or 203 nits when unavailable. Manual values are saved per display.\n80–1000 nits, capped at 80%% of peak; 10-nit steps."),TEXT("当前 %.0f nit，单独控制文字、照片和操作台的亮度；不改变战场曝光或高光峰值。%s\n\n默认跟随当前屏幕的 Windows 白亮度，读取失败时使用 203 nit。先把画面纸白调舒服，再看本页文字与战场操作台。降低刺眼的字和亮边，提高到文字清楚即可。\n\n每块屏幕独立保留手动值。80–1000 nit，最高为屏幕峰值的 80%%；每次调整 10 nit。")},
{TEXT("界面亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n控制文字、照片与操作台的亮度。以文字清楚、亮边柔和为准；仅作用于界面。\n自动值跟随 Windows 白亮度，读取失败时为 203 nit；手动值按屏幕保存。\n范围 80–1000 nit，最高为峰值的 80%%；步长 10 nit。"),TEXT("Interface luminance: %.0f nits. %s\nSets text, photographs and console brightness. Keep lettering clear and bright edges comfortable. Applies to the interface only.\nAutomatic mode uses Windows white luminance, or 203 nits when unavailable. Manual values are saved per display.\n80–1000 nits, capped at 80%% of peak; 10-nit steps."),TEXT("界面亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n\n控制文字、照片和操作台的亮度。调至文字清楚、亮边柔和。战场曝光保持不变。\n\n自动值跟随当前屏幕的 Windows 白亮度；无可用数据时为 203 nit。手动值按屏幕保存。\n\n范围：80–1000 nit，上限为屏幕峰值的 80%%。步进：10 nit。")},
{TEXT("界面亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n控制文字、照片与操作台的亮度。以文字清楚、亮边柔和为准；仅作用于界面。\n自动值跟随 Windows 白亮度，读取失败时为 203 nit；手动值按屏幕保存。\n范围 80–1000 nit，最高为峰值的 80%%；步长 10 nit。"),TEXT("Interface luminance: %.0f nits. %s\nSets text, photographs and console brightness. Keep lettering clear and bright edges comfortable. Applies to the interface only.\nAutomatic mode uses Windows white luminance, or 203 nits when unavailable. Manual values are saved per display.\n80–1000 nits, capped at 80%% of peak; 10-nit steps."),TEXT("Currently %.0f nits: the separate brightness of text, photographs and the console. It does not change battlefield exposure or peak highlights. %s\n\nAutomatic mode follows this display's Windows white level, using 203 nits when unavailable. Set comfortable paper white first, then judge the text here and the battlefield console. Reduce glare while keeping the lettering clear.\n\nManual values are saved per display. 80–1000 nits, limited to 80%% of display peak; 10-nit steps.")},
{TEXT("界面亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n控制文字、照片与操作台的亮度。以文字清楚、亮边柔和为准；仅作用于界面。\n自动值跟随 Windows 白亮度，读取失败时为 203 nit；手动值按屏幕保存。\n范围 80–1000 nit，最高为峰值的 80%%；步长 10 nit。"),TEXT("Interface luminance: %.0f nits. %s\nSets text, photographs and console brightness. Keep lettering clear and bright edges comfortable. Applies to the interface only.\nAutomatic mode uses Windows white luminance, or 203 nits when unavailable. Manual values are saved per display.\n80–1000 nits, capped at 80%% of peak; 10-nit steps."),TEXT("Interface luminance: %.0f nits. %s\n\nSets the brightness of text, photographs and the console. Keep lettering clear and bright edges comfortable. Battlefield exposure is unchanged.\n\nAutomatic values follow Windows white luminance, or 203 nits when unavailable. Manual settings are saved per display.\n\nRange: 80–1000 nits, capped at 80%% of display peak. Step: 10 nits.")},

// HDR.Black
{TEXT("参照块：%.4f nit。十字：%.4f nit。\n检查近黑层次，十字应隐约可辨。室内反光会影响判断；此项仅调整参照图。\n范围 0.0001–0.1 nit，每步减半或加倍。"),TEXT("Reference patch: %.4f nits. Cross: %.4f nits.\nChecks near-black detail; the cross should be faintly visible. Room reflections affect the test. This control changes the reference patch only.\n0.0001–0.1 nits; each step halves or doubles the value."),TEXT("参照块：%.4f nit。十字：%.4f nit。\n\n用于检查近黑层次。十字应隐约可辨；室内反光会影响判断。此项仅调整参照图。\n\n范围：0.0001–0.1 nit。每步减半或加倍。")},
{TEXT("参照块：%.4f nit。十字：%.4f nit。\n检查近黑层次，十字应隐约可辨。室内反光会影响判断；此项仅调整参照图。\n范围 0.0001–0.1 nit，每步减半或加倍。"),TEXT("Reference patch: %.4f nits. Cross: %.4f nits.\nChecks near-black detail; the cross should be faintly visible. Room reflections affect the test. This control changes the reference patch only.\n0.0001–0.1 nits; each step halves or doubles the value."),TEXT("右侧参照块为 %.4f nit，十字为 %.4f nit。它只用来观察屏幕的近黑层次，不改变战场曝光或黑位。\n\n从接近纯黑开始，看十字是否仍能辨认。若暗部被室内反光盖住，先调整环境；不要用这个参照去抬亮整幅游戏。\n\n0.0001–0.1 nit；每次减半或加倍。")},
{TEXT("参照块：%.4f nit。十字：%.4f nit。\n检查近黑层次，十字应隐约可辨。室内反光会影响判断；此项仅调整参照图。\n范围 0.0001–0.1 nit，每步减半或加倍。"),TEXT("Reference patch: %.4f nits. Cross: %.4f nits.\nChecks near-black detail; the cross should be faintly visible. Room reflections affect the test. This control changes the reference patch only.\n0.0001–0.1 nits; each step halves or doubles the value."),TEXT("Reference patch: %.4f nits. Cross: %.4f nits.\n\nChecks near-black detail. The cross should be faintly visible; room reflections affect this test. This control adjusts the reference patch only.\n\nRange: 0.0001–0.1 nits. Each step halves or doubles the value.")},
{TEXT("参照块：%.4f nit。十字：%.4f nit。\n检查近黑层次，十字应隐约可辨。室内反光会影响判断；此项仅调整参照图。\n范围 0.0001–0.1 nit，每步减半或加倍。"),TEXT("Reference patch: %.4f nits. Cross: %.4f nits.\nChecks near-black detail; the cross should be faintly visible. Room reflections affect the test. This control changes the reference patch only.\n0.0001–0.1 nits; each step halves or doubles the value."),TEXT("The reference patch is %.4f nits; its cross is %.4f nits. This only reveals near-black detail and does not alter battlefield exposure or black level.\n\nStart near black and check whether the cross remains distinguishable. If room reflections obscure it, adjust the viewing environment first. Do not use this reference to brighten the whole game.\n\n0.0001–0.1 nits; each step halves or doubles the value.")},

