{TEXT("为战场画面加入细微胶片颗粒。"),TEXT("Adds fine film grain to the battlefield."),TEXT("Fine film grain adds the texture of period photography to the battlefield.")},
{TEXT("为战场画面加入细微胶片颗粒。"),TEXT("Adds fine film grain to the battlefield."),TEXT("Subtle luminance grain lends the battlefield a period-film texture without covering interface text.")},

